# Web UI design (agent must follow)

Source of truth: `apps/web/DESIGN.md`. Do not invent a second palette.

## Forbidden

- **Gradients:** no `linear-gradient`, `radial-gradient`, `conic-gradient`, `bg-gradient-*`, `from-` / `via-` / `to-` washes, mesh/shine overlays.
- **Emoji in the DOM:** no ⚠️ ✨ 🚀 🎉 ✅ ❌ 🟢 🔴 or similar in banners, buttons, labels, empty states, or tables. Use Lucide or Badge text.
- **Off-palette status:** do not use `#2563eb`, `#ef4444`, `#22c55e`, `#fef2f2`, `#991b1b`, Odoo purple, or any red/green not in DESIGN.md.

## Status / error / success (use only these)

| State | Accent | Surface | Text | Border |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Success | `#10b981` | `#dcfce7` | `#14532d` | `#86efac` |
| Warning | `#f59e0b` | `#fef9c3` | `#713f12` | `#fde047` |
| Danger / error | `#f43f5e` | `#fee2e2` | `#7f1d1d` | `#fca5a5` |

Ink `#0f172a`, canvas `#f8fafc`, card `#ffffff`. Solid fills, 1.5px borders, hard offset shadows — no blur elevation.
